            "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:34:41.876274+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is an underrated item that gives 50% worth of stats and a strong upside for only 10k. In comparison to [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), you are gaining more max hp and more sustain on average with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as long as you're spamming M1 and hitting people with your boop. You also gain additional weapon power to boost your damage potential and kill threat. This item is only situationally good on specific characters that can utilize both their abilities and weapons easily, and luckily for us, Lucio is the perfect candidate.\n\n[Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) is the best power to take here because it gives us everything we want: more damage with more boops, more healing from [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c), and more opportunities to take advantage of the ability lifesteal from [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643).",
