            "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:34:41.876274+00:00",
            "notes": "For a more passive and conservative playstyle, [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is a good choice, giving you more healing, more boop damage, and more sustain. If you have the cash and don't feel like you're threatened, opting into building [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) and/or [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) is a strong offensive package that allows you to further your offensive capabilities. More often than not, I end up taking one of the two parts of the package, but for newer players trying out the build, I recommend [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) to understand the limits of the build.",
