            "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:34:41.876274+00:00",
            "notes": "Your Round 7 powers can vary based on what you think the team needs:\n\n[Beat Drop](item_d3d5876b-bd40-4bd9-9954-c65e2295cc2d) is nice to farm beat faster. Sometimes a hypercarry on the enemy team has a game winning ultimate you need to mitigate and sometimes [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) isn't enough. I'd avoid trying to use beat as a fragging ultimate, unless you're Frogger or something. Most of the time though, I don't find this power necessary.\n\n[Megaphone](item_d995adf3-1789-4a16-b85c-21b8c14e4f7d) is nice for extra sustain and longer speed boosts. If you're running an abnormal heal comp, you might need this to help relieve the strain on healing from your other support.\n\n[Let\u2019s Bounce](item_2d846a6e-ff59-4ccc-ae90-c78fad3b4d9b) can be situationally useful, especially on maps that benefit it. If you come across a map with plentiful environmental hazards or walls, the offensive pressure that this power provides is quite nice. It's very strong for booping poorly positioned enemies into your team to kill, but it can just as easily be used to position them further away from being killed.\n\nIf you have a preferred Round 7 power instead of what I suggest here, feel free to take it.\n\nIn terms of items, your gameplan should still be similar to rounds 5 and 6.",
